    LLM: 'Game: Truf. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Truf is an Indonesian trick-taking game for 4 players. Unique bidding: each player simultaneously places a card face-down â€” the rank indicates how many tricks they bid (court cards = 0, A = 1, numbers = face value). Highest bidder's card suit becomes trump. Trump cards are played face down and revealed later. Exact bid = points; over/under = penalty.",
    objective: 'Win exactly the number of tricks bid. Highest total score wins.',
    gameplay: "Bid by placing card face-down (rank = trick bid, court = 0). Highest bid selects trump (their card's suit). Play tricks. Follow suit. Trumps played face-down (hidden). Can't lead trump unless only trumps remain.",
